1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,840
Sixty-four leads, cold for months.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,614
The workflow starts with the stale list.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,540
It enriches every record: company, role, news.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,740
Then scores the fit against your best deals.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,739
Only the top of the list gets a touch.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,062
A short message that names their problem.

7
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,140
Sent from your inbox, not a blast tool.

8
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,340
When a reply lands, it reads it and routes it.

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,109
Sixty-four dead leads revived.

10
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,557
Two to three weeks to build.

11
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,200
Book a fit call.

12
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,313
inodepi.github.io
